		title="Virtual Vehicle Depot Spawner Example (Full parameter reference): every Waldo_fnc_VVDInit parameter shown explicitly (types [""All""], sides [""ALL""], no side-lock, no vehicle-type-lock, keep UAVs, 10 m range, no post-spawn script). The name of the spawner object will be what appears as the garage name. VVD is WIP and not recommended for live missions - see the Virtual Vehicle Depot Spawner Example (Minimal) composition for the smallest working call. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Virtual-Vehicle-Depot";
